<title>CANADA: Hollinger Inc Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Hollinger Inc Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.73		   C$0.05</p>
<p> Net			157,400		    6,500</p>
<p> Revs		     714,600		  427,300</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net unusual items totalled C$143.7 million or C$2.54 per share in 1997 and C$13.7 million or C$0.25 per share in 1996.</p>
<p>Net unusual items in 1997 included a gain of C$108.7 million on the transfer of Canadian Newspaper assets to Hollinger International Inc, a gain of C$39.0 million on the 1997 portion of the sale of Fairfax shares, and a net loss of C$4.1 million in respect of the direct prepaid subscription program at the Telegraph.</p>
<p>((--Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
